4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">4. 지원자격(일부 발췌)</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 전문계고교 졸업자 전형 </span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 학생부 3학년 평균 석차등급이 4</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">.5등급 이내</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">인 자</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 동일계열</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">이라고 인정되는 모집단위</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: -17.5pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 17.5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">5. 수시모집 합격자는 등록하지 않더라도 본교 및 타 대학의 “정시”모집에&nbsp;<br>지원할 수 없음</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: -17.5pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 17.5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">6. </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">농어촌 전형은 모집하지 않음</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
